#. i18n: speaker=hint engineer=you
#: scripts/main.gd:5460
#: scripts/main.gd:5463
msgid "The door is open. Leave through it."
msgstr "Die Tür ist offen. Geh hindurch."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: Hint bar (14 px, about 526 px wide on a keyboard and 488 px on touch; wraps). The sentry is a robot (it).
#. i18n: speaker=hint engineer=you
#: scripts/main.gd:5463
msgid "The sentry is down. Pop the exit bolt by the door."
msgstr "Der Wächter ist außer Gefecht. Löse den Ausgangsriegel an der Tür."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: Hint bar (14 px, about 526 px wide on a keyboard and 488 px on touch; wraps).
#. i18n: speaker=hint engineer=you
#: scripts/main.gd:5465
msgid "Coolant cloud. Get out of it."
msgstr "Kühlmittelwolke. Raus da."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: Hint bar (14 px, about 526 px wide on a keyboard and 488 px on touch; wraps). It: the sentry.
#. i18n: speaker=hint engineer=you
#: scripts/main.gd:5467
msgid "It's after you. Get back over the rubble."
msgstr "Der Wächter ist hinter dir her. Zurück hinter die Trümmer."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: Hint bar (14 px, about 526 px wide on a keyboard and 488 px on touch; wraps). It: the sentry; the mark is the painted spot under the tank.
#. i18n: speaker=hint engineer=you
#: scripts/main.gd:5472
msgid "Wait for WOLF to park it on the mark."
msgstr "Warte, bis WOLF ihn auf der Markierung parkt."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: Hint bar (14 px, about 526 px wide on a keyboard and 488 px on touch; wraps). %s is the key, button or touch word the player uses (it is filled in after translation); keep it first and keep the colon. It: the sentry.
#. i18n: speaker=hint engineer=you slot=key
#: scripts/main.gd:5472
#, c-format
msgid "%s: drop the tank. It's parked on the mark."
msgstr "%s: wirf den Tank ab. Der Wächter steht auf der Markierung."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: Hint bar (14 px, about 526 px wide on a keyboard and 488 px on touch; wraps). %s is the key, button or touch word the player uses (it is filled in after translation); keep it first and keep the colon.
#. i18n: speaker=hint engineer=you slot=key
#: scripts/main.gd:5473
#, c-format
msgid "%s: drop the tank. Land it with the sentry on the mark."
msgstr "%s: wirf den Tank ab, wenn der Wächter auf der Markierung steht."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: Hint bar (14 px, about 526 px wide on a keyboard and 488 px on touch; wraps).
#. i18n: speaker=hint
#: scripts/main.gd:5475
msgid "The tank is falling."
msgstr "Der Tank fällt."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: Hint bar (14 px, about 526 px wide on a keyboard and 488 px on touch; wraps).
#. i18n: speaker=hint engineer=you
#: scripts/main.gd:5477
msgid "The winch is hauling the tank back up. Wait for the clamp."
msgstr "Die Winde zieht den Tank wieder hoch. Warte auf die Klemme."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: Hint bar (14 px, about 526 px wide on a keyboard and 488 px on touch; wraps). It: the sentry.
#. i18n: speaker=hint engineer=you
#: scripts/main.gd:5479
msgid "Stay back over the rubble until it gives up."
msgstr "Bleib hinter den Trümmern, bis der Wächter aufgibt."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: Hint bar (14 px, about 526 px wide on a keyboard and 488 px on touch; wraps). TANK RELEASE is a station plate: glossary TANKAUSLÖSER (the plate itself is not in the template yet, so it still reads English on screen).
#. i18n: speaker=hint engineer=you
#: scripts/main.gd:5481
msgid "You're in its sights. Hide at the TANK RELEASE or the rubble."
msgstr "Der Wächter hat dich im Visier. Versteck dich am TANKAUSLÖSER oder hinter den Trümmern."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: Hint bar (14 px, about 526 px wide on a keyboard and 488 px on touch; wraps). TANK RELEASE is a station plate: glossary TANKAUSLÖSER (the plate itself is not in the template yet, so it still reads English on screen).
#. i18n: speaker=hint engineer=you
#: scripts/main.gd:5483
msgid "WOLF is drawing the sentry onto the mark. Get to the TANK RELEASE."
msgstr "WOLF lockt den Wächter auf die Markierung. Geh zum TANKAUSLÖSER."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: Hint bar (14 px, about 526 px wide on a keyboard and 488 px on touch; wraps). TANK RELEASE is a station plate: glossary TANKAUSLÖSER (the plate itself is not in the template yet, so it still reads English on screen). Its patrol: the sentry's.
#. i18n: speaker=hint engineer=you
#: scripts/main.gd:5485
msgid "WOLF has broken off. Time the drop on its patrol from the TANK RELEASE."
msgstr "WOLF hat abgebrochen. Wirf den Tank vom TANKAUSLÖSER aus, passend zur Runde des Wächters."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: Hint bar (14 px, about 526 px wide on a keyboard and 488 px on touch; wraps). TANK RELEASE is a station plate: glossary TANKAUSLÖSER (the plate itself is not in the template yet, so it still reads English on screen).
#. i18n: speaker=hint engineer=you
#: scripts/main.gd:5486
msgid "The sentry patrols past the rubble. The TANK RELEASE hides you from it."
msgstr "Der Wächter patrouilliert hinter den Trümmern. Am TANKAUSLÖSER sieht er dich nicht."

